 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260829/zhanbao_image_2059493_1787951933_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260829/zhanbao_image_2059493_1787951933_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>维蒂尼亚传射，马尔基尼奥斯读秒绝平，巴黎2-2战平里尔，连续两轮收获平局。</p><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-29/6a91a8f9a89fenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：维拉签下切尔西前锋杰克逊，转会费总价6500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290202275008.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290202275008_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290202275008_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，阿斯顿维拉签下切尔西前锋杰克逊。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-29/6a91eb2e02d83native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：维拉签巴黎前锋姆巴耶达协议，转会费5500万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290411475863_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290411475863_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/202608290411475863_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以here we go确认，维拉签巴黎前锋姆巴耶达协议！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-29/6a91d18ccc821native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">赚麻！切尔西3700万欧签杰克逊，1650万欧租拜仁、7582万欧卖维拉</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-28/6a91a783a73aenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：米兰前锋莱奥加盟加拉塔萨雷，转会费4500万欧+二转</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/202608282322469511_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/202608282322469511_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260828/202608282322469511_1280.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺用标志性的“here we go”确认，AC米兰前锋莱奥将加盟土超加拉塔萨雷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-29/6a91b9